{"id":"df4984a511d297c7","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-UTB-plus.md","title":"带完全真理语言归纳的UTB","display":"df-UTB-plus — 带完全真理语言归纳的UTB","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-UTB-plus","aliases":["91-df-UTB-plus","91-df-UTB^+"],"display":"df-UTB-plus — 带完全真理语言归纳的UTB","depends_on":["[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-UTB-plus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-UTB-plus</span><span>91-df-UTB^+</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-UTB-plus — 带完全真理语言归纳的UTB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-UTB-plus-—-带完全真理语言归纳的-$\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}$\">df-UTB-plus — 带完全真理语言归纳的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}\\)</span> (统一 Tarski 双条件理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (整个扩展语言的归纳模式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> (经典一阶逻辑的演绎闭包)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>” 在这里精确表示加入全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 公式的普通归纳模式；\nUTB 的双条件矩阵仍只遍历基础语言公式。故\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\\)</span> 仍不包含对任意含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 句子的全透明 T-schema。</p>\n<p>在标准算术化和通常的证明编码下，扩展语言归纳允许对 PA 证明作归纳，\n从而导出真理化全局反射</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\n\\to T(x)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\n\\to T(x)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>再结合基础语言的释放实例可得到 PA 的算术反射后果，包括\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。因此，在 PA 一致且满足第二不完备定理\n的通常可递归公理化条件下，这个标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\\)</span> 版本不是\nPA 的算术保守扩张。</p>\n<p>上述反射是由 UTB 双条件、证明编码和扩展归纳共同证明的定理，\n不能把元记号 “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>” 直接放进对象语言公式，\n也不能归因于裸 UTB。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-UTB-plus-—-带完全真理语言归纳的-$\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}$","text":"df-UTB-plus — 带完全真理语言归纳的 $\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\n\\to T(x)\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1724,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB-plus]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"co